This package repackages lexxmark/winflexbison.
Full license texts are included in winflexbison/licenses inside the wheel:
- COPYING.winflexbison (project build scripts)
- COPYING.bison (GNU Bison GPLv3+)
- COPYING.flex (Flex BSD-like license)
- COPYING.DOC (documentation license)

The upstream COPYING file at upstream/COPYING is used for project metadata.
